msgstr "Camera en sensoren:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.6.0.rst:75
msgid ""
"Fixed the OV5640 PCLK/exposure calculation (two MIPI lanes, corrected "
"divider table)."
msgstr ""
"De OV5640 PCLK-/belichtingsberekening gecorrigeerd (twee MIPI-lanes, "
