#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.6.0.rst:190
msgid ""
"The legacy CDC bootloader was replaced by a new TinyUSB-based **standard "
"DFU** bootloader on all boards — the firmware-update mechanism changed; "
"update your flashing workflow/tooling accordingly. The **OpenMV Pro** board,"
" the standalone **Raspberry Pi Pico** build, and the WiFi-debug "
"(``wifidbg``) remote-IDE feature were removed."
msgstr ""
"De oude CDC-bootloader is vervangen door een nieuwe TinyUSB-gebaseerde "
"**standaard-DFU**\\ -bootloader op alle boards — het firmware-"
"updatemechanisme is veranderd; pas je flash-workflow/tooling hierop aan. Het"
" **OpenMV Pro**\\ -board, de standalone **Raspberry Pi Pico**\\ -build en de"
" WiFi-debug (\\ ``wifidbg``\\ ) remote-IDE-functie zijn verwijderd."

